;Description
:This template is used to link to an Instagram account.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Instagram|<username>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's Instagram Profile link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Instagram|mafumafu_ig|mafumafu instagram description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Instagram|mafumafu_ig|mafumafu instagram description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

